 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "In a World Where Levels Rule"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "レベルが支配する世界で"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "One day, the high school boy, Tohru, was summoned by an aristocrat to [a world where levels rule].\n\nUpon discovering that Tohru's level was the absolute lowest, he was then treated as a slave and trapped in a high-level dungeon.\n\nHe vowed to defeat the fearsome monsters in the high-level dungeon, level up higher than everyone else, and return to his original world."
  },
